## 🚀 Installing System-Wide

### Linux
```bash
# Copy to system bin
sudo cp dist/neoswitch /usr/local/bin/

# Run from anywhere
sudo neoswitch
```

### macOS
```bash
# Copy to Applications
sudo cp -r dist/NeoSwitch.app /Applications/

# Run from Spotlight or Applications folder
```

### Windows
```powershell
# Copy to Program Files
Copy-Item dist/neoswitch.exe "C:\Program Files\NeoSwitch\"

# Add to PATH or create desktop shortcut
```

## 🔐 Code Signing (Optional)

### macOS
```bash
# Sign the app
codesign --deep --force --verify --verbose --sign "Developer ID" dist/NeoSwitch.app

# Notarize (for distribution)
xcrun notarytool submit dist/NeoSwitch.app.zip --keychain-profile "AC_PASSWORD"
```

### Windows
```powershell
# Sign with certificate
signtool sign /f certificate.pfx /p password /tr http://timestamp.digicert.com dist/neoswitch.exe
```

## 📦 Creating Installers

### Linux (DEB package)
```bash
# Install fpm
gem install fpm

# Create package
fpm -s dir -t deb -n neoswitch -v 1.0.0 \
    --prefix /usr/local/bin \
    dist/neoswitch=/neoswitch
```

### macOS (DMG)
```bash
# Create DMG
hdiutil create -volname "NeoSwitch" -srcfolder dist/NeoSwitch.app -ov -format UDZO neoswitch.dmg
```

### Windows (NSIS Installer)
```nsis
; Use NSIS script (create installer.nsi)
OutFile "NeoSwitch-Setup.exe"
InstallDir "$PROGRAMFILES\NeoSwitch"
Section
    SetOutPath $INSTDIR
    File "dist\neoswitch.exe"
SectionEnd
```

